<slide>
  transition: slide
  stagger: 0.18
</slide>

<h2>Text transitions</h2>

<p>
  <c>transition:</c> sets how a slide's text enters: <c>fade</c> (default), <c>slide</c>, <c>slide-right</c>, <c>slide-left</c>, <c>zoom</c>, <c>none</c>.
  <c>stagger:</c> delays each block after the previous one.
</p>

<p>This slide: <c>slide</c> with a stagger of <c>0.18</c>.</p>

<notes>
  Defaults for the whole deck: "animation": { "textTransition": ..., "textStagger": ... } in deck.json.
</notes>
